[h1]Notification Filter[/h1]

This mod introduces filtering functionality for some type of Notifications shown in the Ticker window and Logbook.

[h2][b]Features[/b][/h2]
[list]
[*] Set minimum changes of [b]Relation[/b] to be displayed in [b]Notification Ticker[/b] and [b]Logbook[/b] (Separately).
[*] Set a minimum amount of [b]Money[/b] transaction to be displayed in `Notification Ticker`.
[*] Disable notifications related to [b]Crafting Progress[/b] in the `Notification Ticker`.
[*] Disable notifications for collected items in the `Notification Ticker`:
[list]
[*] `Ammo collected`, [b]Ammo received[/b]
[*] `Inventory items collected`, [b]Dropped container collected[/b]
[*] `Materials collected`, [b]Storage: 100% full[/b]
[/list]
[*] Disable notifications related to [b]Station Insufficient Funds[/b] in the [b]Notification Ticker[/b] and `Logbook`.
[*] Disable notifications related to [b]Ship Constructed[/b] in the [b]Logbook[/b] based on the size or cost of the constructed ship.
[/list]
